s its victims' memories, drives them to madness, and twists them into monstrous forms. The story follows Bai Wuchang, a female pirate who returns to her homeland of Shu in search of an ancient artifact said to hold the power to resurrect her younger sister, Bai Yu. After a feathered monstrosity rampages nearby, Wuchang herself becomes afflicted with the Feathering and loses her memory, and she is taken in by a Taoist who shelters her. Setting out for a sanctuary rumored to hold knowledge of the disease, she reunites with her loyal crewmate He Youzai and presses on through a land unraveling into chaos, searching for a cure and the truth of her own past.", "summary": "Wuchang: Fallen Feathers is a soulslike action RPG set in the land of Shu during the dark and tumultuous late Ming Dynasty, plagued by warring factions and a mysterious illness that spawns monstrous creatures.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/wuchang-fallen-feathers", "videos": [{"id": 54840, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "XPo73-CTqsU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XPo73-CTqsU", "title": "WUCHANG: Fallen Feathers - Official Reveal Trailer | 4K 60FPS Gameplay (2021)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XPo73-CTqsU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 74332, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "SDLuntnvl8E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SDLuntnvl8E", "title": "Wuchang: Fallen Feathers - Official 18 Minutes Exclusive Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SDLuntnvl8E/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 115719, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "u7CGFPbfSCY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u7CGFPbfSCY", "title": "WUCHANG: Fallen Feathers Announcement Trailer - Xbox Games Showcase 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u7CGFPbfSCY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 130114, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HPqHQ4ZNI_Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/